# SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-App-Pending
# Reverse-DNS identifiers that are NOT application bundle IDs and may appear in Swift code.
# One Python regular expression per line, matched against the literal's content.
# Adding a line needs a reason in the same commit (docs/decisions/0505-lint-contracts.md).

# Keyboard layout identifiers (PLT-R360, PLT-R362): layout IDs, not apps.
^com\.apple\.keylayout\.
# Input source identifiers and categories reported by Text Input Sources (PLT-R371, PLT-R372).
^com\.apple\.inputmethod\.
# Pasteboard marker types (PLT-R461).
^org\.nspasteboard\.(TransientType|ConcealedType|AutoGeneratedType)$
# Accessibility and distributed notification names (PLT-R370).
^com\.apple\.accessibility\.api$
# Diagnostics block keys whose first component looks like the .app TLD (ADR 0501, PLT-R1202): keys, not apps.
^app\.(version|build|channel)$
